{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00534","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 顺和 · 林锺宫","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 顺和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大乐和畅，殷荐明神。\n一降通感，八变必臻。\n有求斯应，无德不亲。\n降灵醉止，休徵万人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林锺宫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}